(text "Ethernet 10/100, RMII (untrusted from the RMII pins outward)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 13.208 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "36ae5790-b88e-533d-ba3b-59c26f69c3fa"))
(text "VDDA_PHY: analog supply and magnetics centre taps" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 149.86 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c99e91b7-424d-5e9d-8d62-6b7855d99efb"))
(text "VDDIO" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 149.86 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7a53d6a1-5073-5ab8-b239-5dabd7a84042"))
(text "Notes\n1. LAN8742A (LAN8720A fits the same footprint). REF_CLK out mode: LED2/nINTSEL pulled low, so the PHY\n   makes the 50 MHz RMII clock from its 25 MHz crystal and nINT is not available.\n2. Straps left at their internal defaults: MODE[2:0] = 111 (auto-negotiate, all modes), PHYAD0 = 0,\n   REGOFF = 0 (internal 1.2 V regulator on, VDDCR is its output).\n3. ETH_RST_N has a pull-down: the PHY stays in reset until the loader releases it under the network\n   policy, and during FPGA configuration.\n4. LEDs are active high in this strap setting. Check the HR911105A LED polarity against its data sheet.\n5. A medical product needs a magnetics / isolation grade to IEC 60601-1 (open item A6); PoE is not provided.\n6. Crystal load capacitors (22p) to be matched to the crystal chosen." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 162.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4c7c5fa6-8b7b-5ff1-8a95-b615757c4279"))
(text "Host UART over USB-C (status, sessions, updates, CLI)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 267.97 13.208 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "52897412-3665-50e9-b69a-d64aa8b6bd1c"))
(text "CH340N runs from the switched +3V3 (V3 tied to VCC), so the bridge only\nenumerates while the device is on and nothing back-feeds the FPGA.\nVBUS is only sensed (USB_VBUS_DET, 3.0 V), never used as a supply.\nJ7: 3.3 V UART for the bench; overrides the bridge through the 1k." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 271.78 127 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0d8be0dc-6ac0-54ba-a059-6fb119dfff4d"))
(text "Sensor port: authenticated two-way link to the replaceable temperature sensor" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 267.97 145.288 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e950386a-7092-57ed-b80c-fd33148a8a48"))
(text "Physical layer is open (question S2): two 3.3 V lines for a UART,\nor fit the DNP link for one half-duplex line. The port supplies 5 V,\nswitched by the loader and limited by the PTC. Sensor-side\nsignals are clamped by the ESD array." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 271.78 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8cc92e4c-21bc-5df3-b962-c23788b372e9"))
